      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T00:57:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. Old user has been allowed, so that wouldn\u0027t increase any risk though we should fix it.\n2. Throwing Exception would be a problem to new user.\n\nSo, this CL wouldn\u0027t increase any risk, but fix the issue for new user.\nMyles, if you agree on that let me merge this CL and create another one for preventing the usage from old user for Android U.",
